# 🚀 DeFiFun

DeFiFun is a modern decentralized finance (DeFi) platform designed for secure crypto asset management, token trading, staking, and portfolio tracking.

## 🌟 Overview

DeFiFun provides users with a seamless Web3 experience by integrating secure wallet connections, decentralized trading, and real-time portfolio monitoring.

## ✨ Features

- 🔐 Secure Wallet Connection
- 💰 Crypto Asset Management
- 🔄 Token Trading Interface
- 📈 Portfolio Performance Tracking
- 🌐 Blockchain Integration
- ⚡ Fast and Responsive UI
- 🛡️ Smart Contract Support

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- Next.js 14
- React
- Tailwind CSS
- TypeScript
- Ethers.js
- Solidity
- Vercel

