## 🚀 Getting Started

### Clone Repository

bash
git clone https://github.com/iswahyudiirfandi/DEFiFun.git


### Install Dependencies

bash
npm install


### Run Development Server

bash
npm run dev


Open:

text
http://localhost:3000


## 📦 Build for Production

bash
npm run build
npm start


